  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [eslint-plugin-jest](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest) from `v21.13.0` to `v21.17.0`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v21.17.0`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.17.0)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.16.1...v21.17.0)\n##### Features\n\n* add fixer for lowercase-name rule ([#&#8203;119](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/119`)) ([d7f3de3](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/d7f3de3)), closes [#&#8203;118](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/118`)\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.16.1`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.16.1)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.16.0...v21.16.1)\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* handle callexpressions with anonymous calles ([885ce17](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/885ce17))\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.16.0`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.16.0)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.15.3...v21.16.0)\n##### Features\n\n* **rules:** add `no-jasmine-globals` ([#&#8203;116](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/116`)) ([7707e14](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/7707e14))\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.15.3`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.15.3)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.15.2...v21.15.3)\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **rules:** don't crash on require() ([#&#8203;115](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/115`)) ([523e2f4](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/523e2f4)), closes [#&#8203;114](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/114`)\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.15.2`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.15.2)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.15.1...v21.15.2)\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **valid-describe:** allow concise body arrow function ([#&#8203;106](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/106`)) ([4586bdc](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/4586bdc))\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.15.1`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.15.1)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.15.0...v21.15.1)\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **rules:** improve no-identical-title error message ([#&#8203;108](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/108`)) ([8213ada](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/8213ada))\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.15.0`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.15.0)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.14.1...v21.15.0)\n##### Features\n\n* **lowercase-name:** add 'ignore' option ([#&#8203;92](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/92`)) ([03a7cda](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/03a7cda)), closes [#&#8203;76](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/76`)\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.14.1`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.14.1)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.14.0...v21.14.1)\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **valid-describe:** add check for empty arguments ([#&#8203;94](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/94`)) ([80c9b33](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/80c9b33)), closes [#&#8203;93](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/93`)\n\n---\n\n### [`v21.14.0`](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/releases/v21.14.0)\n[Compare Source](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/compare/v21.13.0...v21.14.0)\n##### Features\n\n* **rules:** add 'no-jest-import' rule to the recommended config ([#&#8203;99](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/99`)) ([fb54759](https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/commit/fb54759)), closes [#&#8203;98](`https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest/issues/98`)\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com).",
